Package: npmerger
Title: Build Nonprofit Merger Datasets from IRS 990 Efile Data
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Jesse",
           family = "Lecy",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jdlecy@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-4974-0782"))
Description: Identify nonprofit mergers, asset transfers, dispositions, and
    closures from IRS Form 990 Schedule N filings; classify transactions
    using Schedule N disclosures and Part VII leadership continuity; and
    build donor, recipient, Part VII, and fiscal-health panels around each
    merger event. Data retrieval relies on 'panel990' and fiscal metrics on
    'fiscal'.
URL: https://github.com/Nonprofit-Open-Data-Collective/npmerger
BugReports: https://github.com/Nonprofit-Open-Data-Collective/npmerger/issues
